OL,3,GNEWSAWhy no trains will run from New
OL,4,AStreet at Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo trains will run at one of the
OL,7,Fcountry's busiest railway stations over
OL,8,FChristmas, it has been confirmed.
OL,10,FMajor engineering works mean there will
OL,11,Fbe no services to or from Birmingham
OL,12,FNew Street from 24 to 28 December.
OL,14,FOver the five-day period Network Rail
OL,15,Fwill begin work on a #13m upgrade of
OL,16,Fthe station's overhead power lines,
OL,17,Fwith much of the wiring dating back to
OL,18,Fthe 1960s.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
