OL,3,GNEWSAWhy no trains will run from New
OL,4,AStreet at Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FMartin Colmey, route director for the
OL,7,FNetwork Rail Central route, said there
OL,8,Fwas "never a good time for this type of
OL,9,Fwork" but efforts had been made to
OL,10,F"reduce its impact as much as
OL,11,Fpossible".
